{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112518","id":2989782925,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yNHeN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112518","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112518.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112518.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112518","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112518/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112518/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112518/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f4bad537a7114b901aa55e2531bd675acb6b01c0","number":112518,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix suspension force calculation in VehicleBody3D to accurately follow Hooke's Law","user":{"login":"FuWan722","id":182037074,"node_id":"U_kgDOCtmqUg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182037074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722","html_url":"https://github.com/FuWan722","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuWan722/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112492\r\n\r\n# Modify VehicleBody3D suspension force to follow Hooke's Law.\r\n\r\n## Before, the suspension force was calculated incorrectly, where:\r\n`F(N) = stiffness(N/mm) * offset(m) * vehicle_mass(kg).`\r\nMeaning, as the vehicle gets heavier, the spring does not compress. This is because under the hood, the force is also multiplied by vehicle_mass.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8438dd0c-24a1-4e3d-bc2b-25f0711f3ec8\r\n\r\n## After, the suspension force is calculated as:\r\n`F(N) = stiffness (N/mm) * 1000.0 * offset(m). `\r\nThis can be found in the Hooke's Law for spring. Multiplication of 1000.0 to convert N/mm to N/m\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38c1e240-ccfc-429e-94fb-c85d0bda9fc8\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_i